================================================================================
FUSIONFIESTA - CROSS-PLATFORM COLLEGE EVENT MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
Software Requirements Specification (SRS) Implementation & Project Documentation
Competition: TechWiz 6 - Aptech Global Tech Competition
================================================================================

1. PROBLEM DEFINITION & NECESSITY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
In modern universities and collegiate institutions, dozens of events such as
technical hackathons, cultural festivals, band wars, sports tournaments, and
academic seminars are organized regularly. Managing these activities manually
leads to significant miscommunication, resource mismanagement, scheduling
conflicts, paper ticket loss, delayed certificate distributions, and poor
student engagement.

FusionFiesta resolves these challenges by providing a centralized cross-platform
system powered by Flutter and Google Firebase. It delivers real-time data
synchronization, multi-role security, 1-click event registrations, encrypted
QR pass ticketing, live camera attendance check-ins, automated verified PDF
certificate generation with fee clearance, multi-criteria feedback collection,
campus GPS venue navigation, and executive analytics/report exports (PDF/Excel).


2. DESIGN SPECIFICATIONS & ARCHITECTURE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Architecture Pattern: Multi-Provider Clean Reactive Architecture
Frontend Framework: Flutter 3.44+ with Dart 3.12+ (Material 3 Design)
Color Theme: Sapphire Blue (#2563EB), Neon Cyan (#06B6D4), Emerald Green (#10B981),
             and Amber Gold (#F59E0B) with Midnight Slate (#0F172A). STRICTLY NO PURPLE.
Backend & Database Engine: Google Cloud Firebase (Cloud Firestore NoSQL, Firebase
             Authentication, Firebase Storage, and Security Rules).
State Management: Provider & Reactive Stream Broadcast Controllers.
Document Rendering: Vector PDF Layout & Printing Engine (pdf & printing packages).
Analytics & Charts: Interactive Multi-Series Bar & Metric Displays (fl_chart).
Mapping & Navigation: OpenStreetMap with LatLong2 GPS coordinate integration.


3. DATA FLOW DIAGRAMS (DFD)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[DFD Level 0 - Context Level Diagram]

  +----------------------+             +---------------------------------------+
  |                      |             |                                       |
  |  Student Visitor     |             |         FUSIONFIESTA 2026             |
  |  Student Participant | <=========> |      CROSS-PLATFORM EVENT             |
  |  Event Organizer     |             |      MANAGEMENT APPLICATION           |
  |  System Admin        |             |                                       |
  +----------------------+             +---------------------------------------+
                                                      ||   ^^
                                                      ||   || Live Streams & Writes
                                                      vv   ||
                                       +---------------------------------------+
                                       |      GOOGLE CLOUD FIREBASE            |
                                       |  • Cloud Firestore NoSQL Database     |
                                       |  • Firebase Authentication            |
                                       |  • Firebase Storage & Security Rules  |
                                       +---------------------------------------+

[DFD Level 1 - Detailed Functional Decomposition]

1.0 AUTHENTICATION & ROLE MANAGEMENT:
   Users ---> Sign Up / Sign In ---> Firebase Auth / Firestore Users Collection
   Visitor ---> Profile Upgrade ---> Student Participant (Enrollment ID & ID Proof)
   Staff ---> Register ---> Admin Approval Queue ---> Account Activated

2.0 EVENT LIFECYCLE & SCHEDULING:
   Organizer ---> Propose Event (Banner + Guidelines PDF) ---> Status: Pending
   Admin ---> Review & Approve Proposal ---> Status: Upcoming / Live ---> Public Catalog
   Participant ---> 1-Click Register ---> Slot Check ---> Generate Digital QR Pass

3.0 LIVE CHECK-IN & ATTENDANCE:
   Participant ---> Present QR Pass ---> Organizer Camera / Manual Scanner ---> Attendance Marked

4.0 RESULTS, FEEDBACK & CERTIFICATES:
   Organizer ---> Post Winners ---> Trigger Bulk E-Certificates
   Participant ---> Multi-Parameter Feedback (Org, Rel, Coord, Overall) ---> Event Rating Updated
   Participant ---> Fee Payment Clearance ($50.00) ---> Unlocks Vector PDF Certificate Download

5.0 ADMINISTRATIVE GOVERNANCE & REPORTING:
   Admin ---> Monitor Flagged Feedback & Security Alerts
   Admin ---> Generate On-Demand Executive PDF & Excel (.xlsx) Reports


